# Lab Mate | Student Lab Companion

## About the Project
Lab Mate is a student lab companion web application designed to help students organize their academic tasks, subjects, and notes in one place.

This project was developed to practice frontend development, backend development, API integration, and data management.

## Features
- User signup and login
- Task management
- Subject management
- Notes management
- My Account section
- Dark mode
- Flask backend with JSON-based data storage

## Technologies Used
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Python
- Flask
- JSON

## Project Structure
- `backend/` — Flask application and JSON data files
- `frontend/` — HTML, CSS, and JavaScript files
- `README.md` — Project documentation

## How to Run
1. Open the project folder in VS Code.
2. Activate the Python virtual environment.
3. Install the required dependencies.
4. Run the Flask application using `app.py`.
5. Open the local address displayed in the terminal.

## Purpose
This project was created as a hands-on learning project to develop practical web development and software engineering skills.